{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "Bun-first dependency contract. Each npm package maps to the Bun capability that absorbs it. builtin: the Bun runtime resolves the specifier to its own native module, so declaring it is dead weight. fork: the abandoned aphrody-labs/bun fork resolved it natively (upstream Bun does not; treated as a warning, not an error). native: a Bun API covers it; new imports are refused and the baseline only goes down. gap: no Bun equivalent yet; a fork candidate. Audited by `bun scripts/audit/workspace/bun-absorb.ts`.",
  "scan": {
    "include": "**/*.{ts,tsx,mts,cts,js,mjs,jsx}",
    "exclude": [
      "node_modules",
      "vendor",
      ".cache",
      "dist",
      "build",
      "out",
      ".next",
      "target",
      ".git",
      "var",
      "coverage",
      "scripts/audit/workspace/bun-absorb.test.ts"
    ]
  },
  "packages": [
